<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11554" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαρρησίαστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>deprived of freedom of
				speech,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				103
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιτεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					22.12.2
				</span></i>
			; <i>having no right of speech,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				9.2.2
			</span></i>; <i>not frank,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1457.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.158S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not speaking freely,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				4.5.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.51c
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cal.</u>
				9
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως, εὐλαβεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.477
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>not acting freely,</i> of reptiles, <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.69
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>not freely spoken of,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.428
			</span></i>.</div>
